{
  "id": "1CH.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Makolonika 28",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wapompesheli kuYerusalema tulamba twejima twawaIsarela, wowu atulamba anyichidi, niakulumpi jayendu akalakelelaŋa mwanta hezanvu hezanvu, niakulumpi jamakombakaji niakulumpi jamakulakaji, nianyuli ahembelaŋa yuma yamwanta yejima nimahetindi, niawanyanindi, niatulala, niayilobu, wowu ayilobu akwaŋovu ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Davidi hakwimana zulumba, hakwila nindi, Enuana kwami ninenu antu ami ntiyenu; ami kumuchima wami kwadiŋi jojakutuŋila chimbaŋu chachitiyaŋenu chaYehova itala dakunookela, diikali niitanda dakunyendu yaNzambiyetu, ninodu naloŋesha dehi yakutuŋa nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Nzambi waŋililinindi, Eyi kutuŋila ijina dami itala nehi, muloŋa eyi wumuntu wanjita, wunamwaŋi mashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, mumutaŋa watata yami wejima Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela wantondelumu ami, niikali mwanta wawaIsarela chahayanyaka. Muloŋa yena natondi dehi Yuda akekali nlomboli; kumutaŋa waYuda natondumu mutaŋa watata yami; hadi anyana katata yami wantiyiluhuami kuwaha andiishi wanta wawaIsarela ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadi anyanami ejima—muloŋa Yehova nanyinki anyana amavulu—natondi dehi mwana miSolomoni, ashakami hetanda dawanta waYehova dakuyula aIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waŋila dehi nindi, Mwaneyi Solomoni diyi wakatuŋa itala dami niyipaŋuyami; muloŋa ami namutondi dehi ekali mwanami ninami niikali tatayindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi wakela nimunalejapa nimuwuŋaji wami neyi chadi nakwilayilelu, ami nakakolesha wanta windi chahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu, kunukumesu awaIsarela ejima, chochipompelu chaYehova, kunu kumatu aNzambiyetu, shenu muchima wakukeŋakeŋa mwalejaŋayi Yehova Nzambi yenu mwejima; kulonda mwakaheti ituŋidi dadiwahi, mwakadishiyili anyanenu akayilondela dakekali wuswana wawu wahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila eyimwanami Solomoni, ilukaku Nzambi yatata yeyi, wumukalakeli namuchimawalala chikupu, nayitoŋojoka yakwovwahilamu; muloŋa Yehova washinshikaŋanyichima yejima, welukaŋa yafuukulaŋa yitoŋojoka yejima. Neyiwakamukeŋakeŋa, wakamuwana; neyi wakamuleka, wakakúumba chahayanyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu babalaku; muloŋa Yehova nakutondi dehi kutuŋaitala damalala; dikwatishi wukoŋi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Davidi hakumwinka mwanindi Solomoni chifwikija chekekidakuchisu chatembeli, nichamatalayu, nichakuwuswekelu wayuma yayuyalema, nichamatalayu ahewulu, nichamatalayu amukachi, nichakuwushilu wetanda daluwi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nichifwikija chayuma yejima yatambwiliyi kudi Spiritu, chayipaŋu yetala daYehova, nichamatala anyeŋumukiluku ejima, nichakuwuswekelu wayuma yalema yetala daNzambi, nichakuwuswekelu wayumaya jilikiluwu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nichamazanvu awatupristu nawaLevi, nichanyidimuyejima yakukalakala mwitala daYehova, nichayuma yejima yakukalakala nachu mwitala daYehova; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nichawuru wakupezelesha wakutuŋa nachuyuma yawuru, nichakutuŋa nachu yuma yakukalakala nachu yejima yejina yeŋi; nichayuma yasiliva yejima mwashika pezu yayu, nichayuma yejima yakukalakala nachu mweŋi namwepi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamwinkeli nawa chifwikija chamanoŋu awuru mwashika pezu yawu, nichamanoŋu awu awuru, mwashikapezu yamanoŋu ejima, niyamanopu awu; nichifwikija chamanoŋu asiliva mwashika pezu yamanoŋu ejima, niyamanoŋu awu, mwekalila nyidimuyamanoŋu ejima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamwinkeli niwuru wakupezelesha wakutuŋa nachujimesa jamankendi akutenteka kumesu aNzambi, wajimesa jejima; nisilivajajimesa jasiliva nawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nichifwikija chatutuwa twanyisomu, nichayitasu, nichampasa, jawuru wakoseka; nichambashila jawuru mwashika pezuyambashila jejima; nichambashila jasiliva mwashika pezu yambashila jejima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nichifwikija chakameŋa kakwochela insensi, kawuru wakosekawakupezelesha; niwuru wachifwikija chekalu, wowu akerubi atanjika mpuula jawu, abuta chimbaŋu chachitiyaŋenu chaYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi nindi, Yumivi yejima yanyidimu yachifwikija ichi aŋilukishiliyu kudi Yehova yakusoneka kuchikasa chindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi hakumwila mwanindi Solomoni, nindi, Wakadikwatishapa, wakomikaŋa chacheni, wakakopumu; bayi wutiya womaku, bayi wakamaku; muŋa Yehova Nzambi, Nzambi yami, wudi naneyi, hakakukapeshaku; hakakushiyaku, nichichakamana mudimu wejima wakukalakela itala daYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tala mazanvu awatupristu nawaLevi awa, diwu akakalakala mudimu wetala daNzambi wejima; kunyidimu yejima wakekala nawantuakweti nyichima yakutiya kuwaha, akweti niwukalawenu, kulonda akalakalaŋa nyidimu yeŋi nayeŋi, niakulumpi niantu ejima akela mwejima muwakayileja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
